jsc2go is a port of WebKit's JavaScriptCore and parts of WTF to Go. Most
of its packages were translated from those C++ sources, at WebKit commit
edbf6068f30a6cb59b135c6b647ec637e05d5576 (scripts/setup.sh), and keep
their structure and names. It is therefore a derivative work of them and
is distributed under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or
(at your option) any later version (see LICENSE), the license of the
JavaScriptCore files it derives from that are under the LGPL (the parser
and much of the runtime and built-ins).

